- Will the money last? now says what the answer rests on: a line under the answer counts the numbers that are yours, our guesses and usual figures and names what is not counted yet, and the filled "Check the numbers behind this ↓" opens a card listing each one (the money left over, the match, what goes into the 401(k), spending, Social Security, when you stop, growth, prices) with what one change would do to the age the money runs out; coming back after a change says "Before your change ... Now ...", and a "Go deeper" card links to What matters most, two plans side by side and history.
